>extension_name</code></a>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-vkGetDeviceProcAddr_lazy\"><a href=\"#val-vkGetDeviceProcAddr_lazy\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> vkGetDeviceProcAddr_lazy : \u000A  <span><span>(<span><span><span><a href=\"../Vulkan_types/index.html#type-vk_device\">Vulkan_types.vk_device</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.structure</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes_static</span>.ptr</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A    <span>string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A    <span>unit <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes_static</span>.ptr</span>)</span>\u000A    lazy_t</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-properties_fn\"><a href=\"#type-properties_fn\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> properties_fn</span><span> =\u000A  <span><span><span><a href=\"../Vulkan_types/index.html#type-vk_device\">Vulkan_types.vk_device</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.structure</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.ptr</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Unsigned</span>.uint32 <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>unit <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.ptr</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span><a href=\"#type-host_pointer_properties\">host_pointer_properties</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.structure</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.ptr</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <a href=\"../Vulkan_types/index.html#type-vk_result\">Vulkan_types.vk_result</a></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-resolve_properties_fn\"><a href=\"#val-resolve_properties_fn\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> resolve_properties_fn : \u000A  <span><span><span><a href=\"../Vulkan_types/index.html#type-vk_device\">Vulkan_types.vk_device</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.structure</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes_static</span>.ptr</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><a href=\"#type-properties_fn\">properties_fn</a> option</span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Resolve <code>vkGetMemoryHostPointerPropertiesEXT</code> for <code>device</code>. <code>vkGetDeviceProcAddr</code> returns the entry point of the driver that owns the device (an address inside that driver's library), so the result belongs to this device only: it is kept in the device record and never shared, because a second device may come from another driver. <code>None</code> when the driver does not know the function.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-get_memory_host_pointer_properties\"><a href=\"#val-get_memory_host_pointer_properties\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> get_memory_host_pointer_properties : \u000A  <span><a href=\"#type-properties_fn\">properties_fn</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span><a href=\"../Vulkan_types/index.html#type-vk_device\">Vulkan_types.vk_device</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.structure</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.ptr</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span>unit <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.ptr</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><span><a href=\"#type-host_pointer_properties\">host_pointer_properties</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.structure</span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Ctypes</span>.ptr</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <a href=\"../Vulkan_types/index.html#type-vk_result\">Vulkan_types.vk_result</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>vkGetMemoryHostPointerPropertiesEXT</code> through <code>fn</code>, the function resolved for <code>device</code>: the memory types <code>host_ptr</code> can be imported as. The device must have been created with <a href=\"#val-extension_name\"><code>extension_name</code></a> enabled.</p></div></div>"}